  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: Cornelius6
  <Text>k__BackingField: I knew you'd say that, very well. Ancient texts describe
    an artifact that may be the first piece of this mysterious puzzle, which lies
    deep in the forest islands. I shall meet you further into the forest, I am confident
    you will be capable of reaching me. For now, I bid you adieu.
